<title>USA: BAESA to meet with stock exchange officials.</title>
<headline>BAESA to meet with stock exchange officials.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA (BAESA) said on Friday that it intends to meet with officials from the New York Stock Exchange and the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange regarding trading suspensions.</p>
<p>The exchanges suspended trading after the company reported negative net equity of US$18.7 million under Argentine accounting standards, the company said.</p>
<p>The company reported a second quarter loss of US$29 million for the period ended March 31, 1997.</p>
